flowchart TB
accTitle: Finish the object write before acknowledging queued work
accDescr: The SQS event source mapping invokes a Lambda worker, which retrieves and processes one article. A durable S3 result allows acknowledgement, while failure returns the job to retry or dead-letter handling.
Q[(SQS article URL)]:::storage --> L[Lambda worker<br/>Fetch and analyze article]:::process
L --> S[(S3 result object<br/>Stable job key)]:::storage
S --> A[Return successful processing<br/>Mapping deletes message]:::output
L -->|Processing or write failure| R[Retry after visibility timeout<br/>Then DLQ if retry limit reached]:::warning
